<title>INDIA: Top stocks which moved the BSE Index - August 27.</title>
<headline>Top stocks which moved the BSE Index - August 27.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close  was 3438.80,5.25 points or 0.15 percent higher than Monday's close.</p>
